@format 1
@id project.export-scene
@title Export scene
@area 7. Project persistence
@entry input
@summary Export a stored or current scene as a standalone JSON file selected by the user.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related project.import-scene, project.save-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Export requested <input>
- Resolve the named stored scene or capture the current window @ console.PConsoleExportHandle(...)
> choose

[choose] Choose destination <decision>
- Show the scene save-file dialog @ console.PConsoleExportHandle(...)
? "Dialog is cancelled" > unchanged
? "Destination is chosen" > write

[write] Write scene file <storage>
- Serialize the scene as JSON at the selected path @ scene.LSceneFileSave(...)
> result

[result] Scene exported <output>
= A standalone scene JSON file exists at the chosen path.

[unchanged] Export cancelled <output>
= No scene file is written.
